r Deck each turn. Don't like a card or no longer need it? Place it in the Randomiser to change it to something more useful (hopefully). And many more ways to get cards with card effects that you want, and remove those that you don't.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive and thrive:</strong> strategically build your cards and deck to leverage powerful interactions while gaining favour to make allies and progress. Tactically balance being opportunistic with upgrades and keeping everyone happy. Falling behind may hinder progress and ultimately lead to your downfall!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perks change up gameplay and unlock new strategies:</strong> Unlock perks during runs and assign them before starting a new run. Perks may give bonuses but may have downsides. But the downsides might turn into upsides depending on other Perks! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Game+:</strong> If you need something more challenging, completing your first run will unlock Purgatory Levels, which have increased difficulty and may force some perks to be active. Subsequent Purgatory Levels are unlocked each time you beat a run on the highest unlocked Purgatory Level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481360/extras/313143a9549656af19038693ddba8ba4.poster.avif?t=1768924572\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481360/extras/313143a9549656af19038693ddba8ba4.webm?t=1768924572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481360/extras/313143a9549656af19038693ddba8ba4.mp4?t=1768924572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >65 perks to change up gameplay between runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >91 Card Effects to mix and match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >68 Tier Up Bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play board with 7 different ways to play or manipulate cards (Play Spaces, the Vault, the Combiner, the Randomiser, the Duplicator, and Ascenders Persist and Split). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 phases to complete a run (make an Ally, turn an Enemy into an Ally, defeat the last Enemy)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 unique Purgatory Levels (new game+) for added challenge, where only game-breaking interactions will save you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's new in V1.1? </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >General decrease of difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressing spacebar now launches a firework. Do this to celebrate great plays. Pew pew!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overhaul of some major systems, such as Purgatory Levels, corrupted Card Effects and upgrading of Cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots and lots of buffs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and Bug fixes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
